ent.\n\nPerhaps history will call the shielding, this complete severing of [From.GetName] from the greater cosmos, extreme and unjustified. Or perhaps not. For now, the [From.GetStarName] system has a new planetary terrarium."},{"zh":"[From.From.GetName]炫目的光芒已渐渐黯淡，[From.GetName]归于沉寂。\n\n生活将在封闭的世界中继续。","en":"The glittering beam from the [From.From.GetName] fades, and [From.GetName] is silent.\n\nLife goes on, if contained."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ce799187ebb15e344ce6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"planet_destruction.210.a","label":{"zh":"轻按玻璃看他们蠕动。","en":"Tap on the glass and watch them squirm."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":false,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}}]]},{"key":"planet_destruction.210.b","label":{"zh":"必要的恶。","en":"A necessary evil."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":true,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/planet_destruction_events.txt","line":717},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":false,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":true,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}}]]}],"sets":["fired_pacifier"],"names":{"From.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"planet_destruction.1000","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"对[From.GetName]的观测终止","en":"Observation of [From.GetName] Ceases"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管对[GetPreFTLLower]文明使用超级武器非常有趣，但这也意味着那里已经没什么剩下的可供观测了……","en":"Although using our superweapons against a [GetPreFTLLower] civilization is certainly amusing, it also means that there is now nothing left to observe there..."},{"zh":"[FromFrom.Owner.GetName]的部队摧毁了[From.GetName]的[From.GetPlanetMoon]，杀害了滋生在星球表面的[GetPreFTLLower]文明。结果就是，这里已经没什么剩下的可供观测了……","en":"The forces of the [FromFrom.Owner.GetName] have destroyed the [From.GetPlanetMoon] of [From.GetName], killing the [GetPreFTLLower] civilization that flourished on the surface. As a result, there is now nothing left to observe there..."},{"zh":"[FromFrom.Owner.GetName]的部队已经将[From.GetName]包裹在了不可穿透的护盾中，使得我们不可能继续对滋生在星球表面上的[GetPreFTLLower]文明继续进行观测……","en":"The forces of the [FromFrom.Owner.GetName] have encased [From.GetName] in an impenetrable shield, making it impossible for us to continue observing the [GetPreFTLLower] civilization flourishing on the surface..."},{"zh":"[FromFrom.Owner.GetName]的部队已经将滋生在[From.GetName]的[GetPreFTLLower]文明进行了清除。结果，这里已经没什么剩下的可供观测了……","en":"The forces of the [FromFrom.Owner.GetName] have wiped out the [GetPreFTLLower] civilization that flourished on [From.GetName]. As a result, there is now nothing left to observe there..."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ce799187ebb15e344ce6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"planet_destruction.1000.A","label":{"zh":"那就这样吧。","en":"So be it."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"is_planet_class","arg":"pc_shattered","scope":"from","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_planet_class","arg":"pc_shattered_2","scope":"from","value":false}]]},{"key":"planet_destruction.1000.B","label":{"zh":"对于那些被飞速转化为等离子体的人来说他们表现的不错。","en":"They flail pretty well for those being flash-co